@startuml
title GET /api/oslfs/{address}/{id}/versions — every stored version of one document
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #294C60
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #38789E
  LifeLineBorderColor #6A92AA
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFF3E8
  GroupBorderColor #D97638
}

actor "Document owner" as Owner #FFD8C2
participant "OslfsApiSdk\n.getVersions(id)" as SDK #D5EAF7
participant "Embers API" as API #FFC9A8
participant "OslfsService" as Domain #CDEACC
participant "F1r3node\nread node" as Chain #FFE4A6

Owner -> SDK : getVersions(id)
SDK -> API : GET /api/oslfs/{address}/{id}/versions
API -> Domain : list_versions(address, id)
Domain -> Chain : explore-deploy list_versions.rho
alt document exists
  Chain --> Domain : OslfHeader[] (one per version)
  Domain --> API : Oslfs { oslfs }
  API --> SDK : 200 Oslfs
  SDK --> Owner : version headers
else unknown id for this address
  Chain --> Domain : nothing
  API <-- Domain : not found
  SDK <-- API : 404, no body
end

note over Domain #FFF0C7
Versions are UUIDv7 identifiers: creation order
is recoverable by sorting versions, and
created_at timestamps the write that made each.
end note
@enduml
